@startuml
actor Driver
participant "Driver Orders UI" as UI
participant "Driver OrderController" as C
participant "LoyaltyService" as LS
database DB

Driver -> UI: ضغط تم التوصيل
UI -> C: POST /driver/orders/{id}/delivered
C -> DB: تحقق التعيين + تحديث status=completed
DB --> C: success
C -> LS: awardDeliveredOrderPoints(user, order)
LS -> DB: +3 points transaction
LS --> C: done
C --> UI: success message
@enduml
